[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2505108798","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99775#issuecomment-2505108798","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99775","id":2505108798,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VUO0-","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-28T01:48:57Z","updated_at":"2024-11-28T01:48:57Z","body":"After moving to LocalVectors, almost all of the cost of StringBuilder is from the call to `String(buffer, string_length)`. In my test project that compiles 300 shaders I got roughly:\r\n190 ms in master\r\n90 ms using LocalVector instead of Vector\r\n30 ms using String instead of raw buffer + reserving space in the local vectors\r\n\r\nGiven that, I suspect that this code will still be in the 80-90ms range, although testing is necessary to confirm of course. What error checks do you think are necessary?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2505108798/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2505762287","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99775#issuecomment-2505762287","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99775","id":2505762287,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VWuXv","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-28T10:21:39Z","updated_at":"2024-11-28T20:45:31Z","body":"> What error checks do you think are necessary?\r\n\r\nI had a pretty in-depth look at `ustring.cpp` yesterday (for some reason, this discussion sucked me in). `copy_from` (called from the constructor) runs 3 checks that are costly:\r\n\r\n1) Find the length of the string, clipped to `p_clip_to` if supplied.\r\n2) Run a dubious cast to `uint8_t`, possibly preventing autovectorization.\r\n3) Include an `if` branch on `'\\0\\'` in the critical loop, preventing autovectorization.\r\n\r\nNumber 2) is wholly unnecessary, as indicated by my test: [onlinegdb test code](https://onlinegdb.com/EGWnFbsxF). Casting rules of the C++ spec ensure this should not be different under any compiler, so we should be able to refactor the ternary with a simple `static_cast<uint8_t>(p_cstr[i])`. A [short test](https://godbolt.org/z/PY8xW9EWa) indicates this check is optimized away by some compilers (e.g. clang) but not by others (MSVC).\r\n\r\nThis leaves number 1) and number 3).\r\nNumber 1) clips the string to the first `'\\0'` character it finds.\r\nNumber 3) again checks for `'\\0'`, and if found, prints an error.\r\n\r\nIt is impossible to trigger the Number 3) check, because the 1) check will terminate the string early anyway. Though the reliance on `NULL` termination and repeated length checks is [another discussion](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/11249) we should have.\r\n\r\nTo answer your question directly: After going in-depth, I don't think any of these are necessary, but whether or not they are should be discussion of other PRs.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2505762287/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506928757","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99775#issuecomment-2506928757","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99775","id":2506928757,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6VbLJ1","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-29T01:41:26Z","updated_at":"2024-11-29T01:41:26Z","body":"I removed the static-string length parts. They weren't working anyway yet, and I've been moving to a more well-rounded approach to avoiding `strlen` calls. In any case, this should make the PR even less contentious to merge.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2506928757/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526180965","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99775#issuecomment-2526180965","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99775","id":2526180965,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6WknZl","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-08T15:27:10Z","updated_at":"2024-12-08T15:27:19Z","body":"> Not sure the changes in the cpp file has any impact on performance. But changing to local Vector is definitely a good thing \r\n\r\nYou're right. I just did some more tests. I think something about using buffer pointers directly confuses the compiler. In some instances i even got worse results by removing the running index. In any case, I've just removed the `.cpp` changes, just to be agnostic. It should be a trivial merge now.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2526180965/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2529378522","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99775#issuecomment-2529378522","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99775","id":2529378522,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6Ww0Da","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-09T20:28:25Z","updated_at":"2024-12-09T20:28:25Z","body":"Let's go ahead and merge this for now as it makes a huge difference and is totally safe. \r\n\r\nHowever, I do think we can go ahead with the changes from https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/97777\r\n\r\nI don't think the extra validation from calling `String()` is relied upon, so appending directly into a String will make this way faster (in my testing it made StringBuilder essentially as fast as StringBuffer for shader compilation). Additionally, the addition of the `clear()` method allows us to use `thread_local` versions of this for places where it will be called at run time to allow us to avoid any allocations at run time (after the first few calls of course).\r\n\r\nTo be clear. I think we should merge this and then evaluate the other improvements in follow up PRs (including potentially just replacing the current implementation with what we currently have in StringBuffer)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2529378522/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532782290","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/99775#issuecomment-2532782290","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99775","id":2532782290,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6W9zDS","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-10T20:17:08Z","updated_at":"2024-12-10T20:17:08Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2532782290/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]